.TH SIGMA-SH 1 "2026-03-31" "SigmaOS 1.0" "SigmaOS User Commands"
.SH NAME
sigma-sh \- Sovereign zero-dependency interactive shell and PQC command interpreter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-sh
[\ \fIOPTIONS\fR\ ]
[\ \fISCRIPT_FILE\fR\ ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-sh
is the native interactive command shell and script interpreter for SigmaOS. Built with zero-dependency bare-metal Rust principles, it provides OpenBSD Pledge/Unveil sandboxing, Landlock filesystem isolation, Post-Quantum Cryptographic (PQC) binary execution verification, and POSIX-compliant scripting capabilities.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c \ \fICOMMAND\fR
Read and execute commands from the provided \fICOMMAND\fR string argument.
.TP
.BR \-i
Force interactive shell session with history, tab completion, and syntax highlighting.
.TP
.BR \-\-pqc\-enforce
Enforce Post-Quantum Cryptographic (Dilithium-5 / Kyber-1024) signature validation on all executed ELF binaries.
.TP
.BR \-\-pledge\ \fIPROMISES\fR
Restrict system calls for the shell session matching OpenBSD pledge promises (e.g., "stdio rpath wpath cpath exec").
.TP
.BR \-\-unveil\ \fIPATH:PERM\fR
Restrict filesystem visibility matching OpenBSD unveil rules (e.g., "/usr/bin:rx").
.TP
.BR \-v ",\ " \-\-version
Display \fBsigma-sh\fR version and PQC security engine status.
.TP
.BR \-h ",\ " \-\-help
Print usage summary and exit.
.SH BUILTIN COMMANDS
.TP
.B cd \fI[DIR]\fR
Change the current working directory to \fIDIR\fR (defaults to $HOME).
.TP
.B exit \fI[STATUS]\fR
Exit the shell with optional integer status code.
.TP
.B pledge \fI[PROMISES]\fR
Apply OpenBSD-style syscall promise restrictions to the active shell process.
.TP
.B unveil \fI[PATH]\ \fI[PERMISSIONS]\fR
Restrict path visibility for subsequent child processes.
.TP
.B Pqc-status
Report TPM 2.0 PCR attestation and Dilithium-5 cryptographic signature status.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SIGMA_PQC_STRICT
When set to "1", non-PQC signed executables are rejected with \fBEACCES\fR.
.TP
.B PATH
Colon-separated list of directories searched when resolving commands.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-pkg (8),
.BR landlock (7),
.BR pledge (2)
